{
  "id": "1051",
  "title": "Scrambled Eggs",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-08-29",
  "synopsis": "Ben confuses scrambled eggs with Michael Jordan.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1051/1c6a94fda6fb8e52d0bba7510517a2121318b46a.mp3?1595859399",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "炒蛋\n\n本：老师，你知道炒蛋吗？\n老师：知道啊，你喜欢吃吗？\n本：炒蛋不可以吃，他是美国人，篮球打得很好！\n老师：哦……你说的是“乔丹”吧？",
    "traditional": "炒蛋\n\n本：老師，你知道炒蛋嗎？\n老師：知道啊，你喜歡吃嗎？\n本：炒蛋不可以吃，他是美國人，籃球打得很好！\n老師：哦……你說的是“喬丹”吧？"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Scrambled Eggs"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：老师，你知道炒蛋吗？",
      "traditional": "本：老師，你知道炒蛋嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn lǎo shī nǐ zhī dào chǎo dàn ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Teacher, do you know “chaodan”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "老师：知道啊，你喜欢吃吗？",
      "traditional": "老師：知道啊，你喜歡吃嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī zhī dào a nǐ xǐ huan chī ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher: I do know “chaodan”. Do you like eating them?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：炒蛋不可以吃，他是美国人，篮球打得很好！",
      "traditional": "本：炒蛋不可以吃，他是美國人，籃球打得很好！",
      "pinyin": "běn chǎo dàn bù kě yǐ chī tā shì měi guó rén lán qiú dǎ de hěn hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: You can’t eat “chaodan”. He is American and plays basketball very well!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "老师：哦……你说的是“乔丹”吧？",
      "traditional": "老師：哦……你說的是“喬丹”吧？",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī ò nǐ shuō de shì qiáo dān ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher: Oh…are you talking about “Qiaodan” (Jordan)?"
    }
  ],
